      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فَعَلَ ذٰلِكَ غِيَاظَكَ</span></b> , and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">غِيَاظَيْكَ</span>, (K, * TA,)
